</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Maglinte</surname><given-names>DD</given-names></name><name><surname>Balthazar</surname><given-names>EJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Kelvin</surname><given-names>FM</given-names></name><name><surname>Megibow</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The role of radiology in the diagnosis of small bowel obstruction</article-title><source>AJR</source><year>1997</year><volume>168</volume><fpage>1171</fpage><lpage>1180</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9129407</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chin</surname><given-names>EH</given-names></name><name><surname>Hazzan</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Herron</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Salky</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Laparoscopic retrieval of intraabdominal foreign bodies</article-title><source>Surg Endosc</source><year>2007</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>1457</fpage><comment>Epub 2007 May 19.</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17593464</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00464-006-9011-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Palanivelu</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Rangarajan</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Rajapandian</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Vittal</surname><given-names>SK</given-names></name><name><surname>Maheshkumaar</surname><given-names>GS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Laparoscopic retrieval of 'stubborn' foreign bodies in the foregut: a case report and literature survey</article-title><source>Surg Laparosc Endosc Percutan Tech</source><year>2007</